cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, the Audit Closure Operator Lambda_10, or the Ouroboros Thesis v10, please cite as below."
title: "Ouroboros Thesis v10 — EXHAUSTIVE-AUDIT: The Audit Closure Operator Λ₁₀"
abstract: >-
  v10 of the Ouroboros thesis chain introduces the Audit Closure Operator
  Lambda_10, a machine-verifiable meta-invariant over the v1..v7+Omega Lutar
  family. For each layer L_k define A_k = L_k * product over six artefact
  indicators (CODE, CODEX, API, TEST, THESIS, SURFACE); Lambda_10 = sum A_k.
  Closure theorem: Lambda_10 / sum L_k = 1 if and only if every artefact is
  present for every layer. Strictly inert in the all-operational limit,
  quantifies operational drift exactly by the missing fraction otherwise.
  Implemented as lutarV10Audit, POST /api/ouroboros/lutar/v10, codex node
  lutar_v10, and an 8-test guardrails suite.
